OL,3,GNEWSACalls for Sir Patrick Stewart blue
OL,4,Aplaque exception
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP is calling for a blue plaque to
OL,7,Fhonour the life and legacy of Sir
OL,8,FPatrick Stewart in his West Yorkshire
OL,9,Fhometown.
OL,11,FThe Mirfield-born star died in October
OL,12,Faged 86 after living with Alzheimer's
OL,13,FDisease and Lewy Body Dementia.
OL,15,FMP for Spen Valley, Kim Leadbeater, has
OL,16,Fasked to make an "exceptional
OL,17,Fprovision" to honour Sir Patrick,
OL,18,Fdespite the National Blue Plaque
OL,19,FScheme's eligibility criteria requiring
OL,20,Fthe person being commemorated to have
OL,21,Fdied at least 20 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
