OL,3,GNEWSACalls for Sir Patrick Stewart blue
OL,4,Aplaque exception
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistoric England said although Sir
OL,7,FPatrick was not eligible for a plaque
OL,8,F"just yet", there would be "many other
OL,9,Fways that he will be celebrated and
OL,10,Fcommemorated".
